    "detailed_description": "Enter the Arena! Drag your troops! Build your Battle Deck and Outplay the enemy in fast-paced real-time battles. Be a LEGEND, battle in multiplayer, real-time game starring advanced robots &amp; heroes &amp; buildings against world-wide.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nULTIMATE ARENA BATTLE<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreate the best deck and takedown your rivals<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBECOME A MASTER OF DECK BUILDING<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose special Cards to your Battle Deck &amp; Move toward to the Arena for Victories! (Step into the Arena)<br />\r\nDrag your Cards wisely and take down the enemy towers from your battleverse.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCOLLECT AND LEVEL UP 60+ CARDS<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollect and upgrade limited 60+ Cards featuring advanced units &amp; structures &amp; support. Win Battles with your special Cards for your collection and moving on to new Arenas!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBE A LEGEND<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDefeat the top players in the world by fighting your way into the League and Global Tournaments.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVictory for reputation and prize.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSEASONAL EVENTS<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnlock new Seasonal items like Tower Skins, Emotes and powerful Magic items with the Season Pass and participate in fun Challenges that put your skills to the test.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJOIN A CLAN!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nForm or join a clan and BATTLE enemy clans in Clan Wars for GRAND rewards!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWE JUST HAVE BEGUN!",
    "about_the_game": "Enter the Arena! Drag your troops! Build your Battle Deck and Outplay the enemy in fast-paced real-time battles. Be a LEGEND, battle in multiplayer, real-time game starring advanced robots &amp; heroes &amp; buildings against world-wide.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nULTIMATE ARENA BATTLE<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreate the best deck and takedown your rivals<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBECOME A MASTER OF DECK BUILDING<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose special Cards to your Battle Deck &amp; Move toward to the Arena for Victories! (Step into the Arena)<br />\r\nDrag your Cards wisely and take down the enemy towers from your battleverse.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCOLLECT AND LEVEL UP 60+ CARDS<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollect and upgrade limited 60+ Cards featuring advanced units &amp; structures &amp; support. Win Battles with your special Cards for your collection and moving on to new Arenas!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBE A LEGEND<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDefeat the top players in the world by fighting your way into the League and Global Tournaments.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVictory for reputation and prize.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSEASONAL EVENTS<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnlock new Seasonal items like Tower Skins, Emotes and powerful Magic items with the Season Pass and participate in fun Challenges that put your skills to the test.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJOIN A CLAN!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nForm or join a clan and BATTLE enemy clans in Clan Wars for GRAND rewards!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWE JUST HAVE BEGUN!",
